ounty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025, November to December finished at 48% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February and February to March both sit at 41% of normal there. Grid 16358 had its driest year in 2010, at 61% of normal.</p>"}
